                                           "highlights":  "\u003carticle class=\"lzd-article\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eC\u0026Ocirc;NG DỤNG:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eL\u0026agrave;m sạch s\u0026acirc;u, loại bỏ được b\u0026atilde; nhờn thừa tr\u0026ecirc;n da, c\u0026aacute;c lớp bụi bẩn v\u0026agrave; c\u0026aacute;c tạp chất tr\u0026ecirc;n da.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCung cấp dưỡng chất để l\u0026agrave;m tăng sắc tố cho lan da.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eL\u0026agrave;m trẻ h\u0026oacute;a c\u0026aacute;c tế b\u0026agrave;o của da v\u0026agrave; ngừa l\u0026atilde;o h\u0026oacute;a da tuyệt vời.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGi\u0026uacute;p giữ ẩm v\u0026agrave; duy tr\u0026igrave; sự đ\u0026agrave;n hồi cho da mịn m\u0026agrave;ng, s\u0026aacute;ng hồng rạng rỡ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNgăn\u0026nbsp;Ngừa\u0026nbsp;mụn hiệu quả.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCung cấp lượng nước cần thiết cho da v\u0026agrave; kh\u0026ocirc;ng g\u0026acirc;y ra t\u0026igrave;nh trạng th\u0026ocirc; r\u0026aacute;p tr\u0026ecirc;n da.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTạo ra lớp m\u0026agrave;ng bảo vệ da khỏi t\u0026aacute;c động từ m\u0026ocirc;i trường như: tia UV, bụi bẩn..\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDa mềm mịn kh\u0026ocirc;ng căng sau sử dụng\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHƯỚNG DẪN SỬ DỤNG:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBước 1: L\u0026agrave;m ướt mặt, lấy 1 lượng gel vừa đủ v\u0026agrave; tạo bọt với nước\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBước 2: Massage đều l\u0026ecirc;n mặt, đặc biệt v\u0026ugrave;ng tr\u0026aacute;n v\u0026agrave; v\u0026ugrave;ng chữ T\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBước 3: Xả lại bằng nước sạch để hết bọt \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLƯU \u0026Yacute;:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTr\u0026aacute;nh thoa v\u0026agrave;o mắt hoặc vết thương hở\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTr\u0026aacute;nh xa tầm tay trẻ em\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.7;text-align: left;text-indent: 0;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBảo quản nhiệt